# Styling

- Brand colors via CSS variables in `app/globals.css` (`--color-primary`, `--color-accent`).
- Display font for hero headings; sans for body copy.
- CTAs: pill shape (`rounded-full`), hover lift (`-translate-y-0.5`).
- Responsive type with `clamp()` or Tailwind responsive utilities.
- Avoid magic hex in components — use `bg-primary`, `text-accent`, etc.
- Respect `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.
